{"page":585,"width":1670,"height":2476,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"648","words":[{"text":"648","x":164,"y":146,"width":57,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 피일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":290,"y":149,"width":115,"height":27},{"text":"14","x":418,"y":152,"width":35,"height":21},{"text":"피일","x":480,"y":152,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"시스템","x":530,"y":152,"width":62,"height":24},{"text":"구현","x":600,"y":153,"width":42,"height":24}]},{"text":"있다. A卜돈자는 작성한 스냅숏•을 언제 어느 시점에서라도 접근할 수 있다. 스냅숏 기능은","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":293,"y":271,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"A卜돈자는","x":373,"y":272,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"작성한","x":503,"y":272,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"스냅숏•을","x":601,"y":273,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"언제","x":731,"y":274,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"어느","x":799,"y":274,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시점에서라도","x":869,"y":273,"width":181,"height":36},{"text":"접근할","x":1063,"y":274,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1168,"y":274,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1216,"y":273,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"스냅숏","x":1302,"y":272,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"기능은","x":1417,"y":272,"width":95,"height":33}]},{"text":"백업을 위해서도 상당히 유공하고, 테스트, 그리고 디버깅을 위해서도 활용될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"백업을","x":291,"y":328,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"위해서도","x":398,"y":329,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"상당히","x":530,"y":330,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"유공하고,","x":631,"y":331,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"테스트,","x":771,"y":331,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"그리고","x":882,"y":331,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"디버깅을","x":989,"y":331,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"위해서도","x":1128,"y":331,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"활용될","x":1274,"y":328,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1391,"y":329,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1442,"y":328,"width":69,"height":34}]},{"text":"WAFL의 스냅숏 기능은 매우 효율적이고, 이것은 각 데이터 파일에 대해 쓰기 시 복사","words":[{"text":"WAFL의","x":289,"y":386,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"스냅숏","x":434,"y":387,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"기능은","x":536,"y":386,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"매우","x":635,"y":387,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"효율적이고,","x":704,"y":387,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"이것은","x":874,"y":388,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"각","x":977,"y":388,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":1021,"y":388,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"파일에","x":1127,"y":387,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":1240,"y":386,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"쓰기","x":1320,"y":385,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"시","x":1402,"y":384,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"복사","x":1447,"y":385,"width":65,"height":34}]},{"text":"(copy-on-wnte)조차도 필요로 하지 않는다. 다른 파일 시스템들도 스냅숏 기능을 제공","words":[{"text":"(copy-on-wnte)조차도","x":290,"y":444,"width":328,"height":39},{"text":"필요로","x":630,"y":444,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"하지","x":728,"y":444,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"않는다.","x":797,"y":444,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":906,"y":445,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":977,"y":445,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"시스템들도","x":1051,"y":444,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"스냅숏","x":1222,"y":443,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"기능을","x":1336,"y":442,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"제공","x":1449,"y":441,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"하지만, 대부뿐 이것보다 비효율적으로 동작한다. WAFL에서 제공하는 스냅숏 기능에","words":[{"text":"하지만,","x":289,"y":499,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"대부뿐","x":405,"y":501,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"이것보다","x":508,"y":500,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"비효율적으로","x":638,"y":501,"width":174,"height":35},{"text":"동작한다.","x":826,"y":501,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"WAFL에서","x":969,"y":501,"width":162,"height":35},{"text":"제공하는","x":1152,"y":501,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"스냅숏","x":1298,"y":500,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"기능에","x":1415,"y":499,"width":93,"height":36}]},{"text":"대한 자세한 설명을 위한 그림으로, 다음의 그림 14.13을 보기 바란다.","words":[{"text":"대한","x":291,"y":557,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"자세한","x":362,"y":558,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"설명을","x":464,"y":558,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"위한","x":561,"y":558,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"그림으로,","x":629,"y":558,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"다음의","x":765,"y":558,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"그림","x":864,"y":558,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"14.13을","x":936,"y":559,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"보기","x":1058,"y":559,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"바란다.","x":1133,"y":558,"width":104,"height":34}]},{"text":"WAFL의 새 버전들은 실제로 클론〈clones)이라고 알려진 읽기-쓰기 스냅숏을 허","words":[{"text":"WAFL의","x":345,"y":614,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"새","x":488,"y":615,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"버전들은","x":531,"y":615,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"실제로","x":659,"y":615,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"클론〈clones)이라고","x":759,"y":616,"width":271,"height":36},{"text":"알려진","x":1045,"y":616,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"읽기-쓰기","x":1157,"y":616,"width":155,"height":34},{"text":"스냅숏을","x":1332,"y":615,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"허","x":1481,"y":617,"width":25,"height":34}]},{"text":"용한다. 또한 이 클론은 스냅숏과 동일한 기법을 시용하기 때문에 효율적이다. 이 경우","words":[{"text":"용한다.","x":288,"y":671,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":402,"y":672,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":476,"y":672,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"클론은","x":517,"y":673,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"스냅숏과","x":617,"y":671,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"동일한","x":746,"y":672,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"기법을","x":851,"y":672,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"시용하기","x":954,"y":672,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"때문에","x":1095,"y":673,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"효율적이다.","x":1206,"y":673,"width":174,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":1400,"y":674,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"경우","x":1448,"y":673,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"읽기 전용 스냅숏•은 파일 시스템의 상태를 포착하고 클론은 이 읽기 전용 스냅죴을 역으","words":[{"text":"읽기","x":290,"y":729,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"전용","x":362,"y":729,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"스냅숏•은","x":432,"y":729,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":560,"y":729,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":630,"y":728,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"상태를","x":757,"y":728,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"포착하고","x":857,"y":729,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"클론은","x":990,"y":731,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":1098,"y":730,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"읽기","x":1144,"y":731,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"전용","x":1221,"y":730,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"스냅죴을","x":1299,"y":731,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"역으","x":1449,"y":732,"width":61,"height":33}]},{"text":"로 가리킨다. 클론에 행해지는 쓰기는 새로운 블록에 저장되고 클론의 포인터는 갱신되","words":[{"text":"로","x":288,"y":790,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"가리킨다.","x":331,"y":785,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"클론에","x":472,"y":786,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"행해지는","x":573,"y":786,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기는","x":700,"y":786,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":801,"y":786,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"블록에","x":902,"y":787,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"저장되고","x":1010,"y":787,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"클론의","x":1150,"y":788,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"포인터는","x":1264,"y":789,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"갱신되","x":1416,"y":789,"width":91,"height":35}]},{"text":"어 새로운 블록을 가리키게 된다. 원본 스냅숏은 변경되지 않기 때문에 클론이 갱신되기","words":[{"text":"어","x":288,"y":843,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"새로운","x":329,"y":843,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"블록을","x":430,"y":844,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"가리키게","x":531,"y":843,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":658,"y":843,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"원본","x":737,"y":844,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"스냅숏은","x":805,"y":844,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"변경되지","x":939,"y":845,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"않기","x":1076,"y":845,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"때문에","x":1153,"y":845,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"클론이","x":1265,"y":847,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"갱신되기","x":1382,"y":847,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"이전에 유지하던 파일 시스템 상태를 제공한다. 클론은 또한 원본 파일 시스템을 대체하","words":[{"text":"이전에","x":288,"y":901,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"유지하던","x":389,"y":901,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":518,"y":901,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":588,"y":901,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"상태를","x":686,"y":901,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"제공한다.","x":786,"y":901,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"클론은","x":925,"y":903,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"또한","x":1031,"y":902,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"원본","x":1108,"y":903,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"파일","x":1185,"y":903,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"시스템을","x":1266,"y":904,"width":134,"height":34},{"text":"대체하","x":1414,"y":904,"width":97,"height":34}]},{"text":"도록 상승할 수 있다. 이 상승은 모든 기존 포인터와 연관된 기존 블록들을 폐기한다. 클","words":[{"text":"도록","x":286,"y":960,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"상승할","x":358,"y":959,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":458,"y":959,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":501,"y":959,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":578,"y":959,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"상승은","x":616,"y":959,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":715,"y":960,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"기존","x":787,"y":959,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"포인터와","x":856,"y":960,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"연관된","x":993,"y":960,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"기존","x":1099,"y":960,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"블록들을","x":1175,"y":960,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"폐기한다.","x":1324,"y":961,"width":139,"height":34},{"text":"클","x":1478,"y":964,"width":31,"height":31}]},{"text":"론은 원본은 변경되지 않은 상태에서 테스팅이 끝나거나 업그레이드가 실패할 경우 클","words":[{"text":"론은","x":286,"y":1016,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"원본은","x":361,"y":1016,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"변경되지","x":464,"y":1016,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"않은","x":593,"y":1016,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"상태에서","x":662,"y":1016,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"테스팅이","x":795,"y":1016,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"끝나거나","x":928,"y":1017,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"업그레이드가","x":1070,"y":1017,"width":197,"height"